msgstr "Perubahan API yang merusak"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:108
msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v3.2.0 and v3.3.0. Scope: Python C-modules "
"in ``modules/`` and Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``."
msgstr ""
"Perubahan API yang terlihat oleh pengguna antara v3.2.0 dan v3.3.0. Cakupan:"
" modul C Python di ``modules/`` dan library Python di "
"``scripts/libraries/``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:111
msgid "Each change is tagged with its impact:"
msgstr "Setiap perubahan diberi tag dampaknya:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:113
msgid ""
"*major* — affects most scripts that used the feature; you will need to port "
"code."
msgstr ""
"*major* — memengaruhi sebagian besar skrip yang menggunakan fitur ini; Anda "
"perlu melakukan porting kode."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:115
msgid "*minor* — narrow API; only affects scripts that used it."
msgstr ""
"*minor* — API yang sempit; hanya memengaruhi skrip yang menggunakannya."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:116
msgid "*behavior* — same API, different results; re-check tuned scripts."
msgstr ""
"*behavior* — API sama, hasil berbeda; periksa ulang skrip yang sudah "
"disetel."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:118
msgid ""
"Changes are grouped by impact in that order. If you just want to port your "
"code, jump to the :ref:`migration checklist <v3_3_0_migration>` at the end. "
"Each commit hash links to its diff on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Perubahan dikelompokkan berdasarkan dampak dalam urutan tersebut. Jika Anda "
"hanya ingin melakukan porting kode, langsung ke :ref:`daftar periksa migrasi"
" <v3_3_0_migration>` di bagian akhir. Setiap hash commit menautkan ke diff-"
"nya di GitHub."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:125
msgid "``cpufreq`` API reworked *(major)*"
msgstr "API ``cpufreq`` didesain ulang *(major)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:127
msgid ""
"The ``cpufreq`` module was reworked for H7 support. The "
"``cpufreq.CPUFREQ_120MHZ`` / ``144`` / ``168`` / ``192`` / ``216MHZ`` "
"constants and ``cpufreq.get_frequency()`` were removed. "
"``cpufreq.set_frequency()`` now takes a plain MHz integer (e.g. "
"``cpufreq.set_frequency(120)``), and ``cpufreq.get_current_frequencies()`` /"
" ``cpufreq.get_supported_frequencies()`` were added."
msgstr ""
"Modul ``cpufreq`` telah didesain ulang untuk dukungan H7. Konstanta "
"``cpufreq.CPUFREQ_120MHZ`` / ``144`` / ``168`` / ``192`` / ``216MHZ`` dan "
"``cpufreq.get_frequency()`` dihapus. ``cpufreq.set_frequency()`` kini "
"menerima integer MHz biasa (mis. ``cpufreq.set_frequency(120)``\\ ), dan "
"``cpufreq.get_current_frequencies()`` / "
"``cpufreq.get_supported_frequencies()`` ditambahkan."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:134
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `6babf84a1 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/6babf84a1>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commit:* `6babf84a1 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/6babf84a1>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:139
msgid "``image.replace()`` positional arguments shifted *(minor)*"
msgstr "Argumen posisional ``image.replace()`` bergeser *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:141
msgid ""
"``image.replace()`` gained a ``transpose`` argument, shifting the positional"
" ``mask`` argument from position 4 to position 5. Code that passed ``mask`` "
"positionally (e.g. ``img.replace(src, hmirror, vflip, mask)``) must switch "
"to the keyword form ``img.replace(src, mask=mask)``."
msgstr ""
"``image.replace()`` mendapatkan argumen ``transpose``\\ , menggeser argumen "
"posisional ``mask`` dari posisi 4 ke posisi 5. Kode yang meneruskan ``mask``"
" secara posisional (mis. ``img.replace(src, hmirror, vflip, mask)``\\ ) "
"harus beralih ke bentuk kata kunci ``img.replace(src, mask=mask)``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:146
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `dbe7bf059 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/dbe7bf059>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commit:* `dbe7bf059 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/dbe7bf059>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:151
msgid ":func:`sensor.alloc_extra_fb` no longer accepts Bayer/JPEG *(minor)*"
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.alloc_extra_fb` tidak lagi menerima Bayer/JPEG *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:153
msgid ""
":func:`sensor.alloc_extra_fb` no longer accepts ``sensor.BAYER`` or "
"``sensor.JPEG`` (it now also supports ``sensor.BINARY``). Code that "
"allocated extra framebuffers in Bayer or JPEG format must use ``GRAYSCALE`` "
"/ ``RGB565`` (or allocate the buffer another way)."
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.alloc_extra_fb` tidak lagi menerima ``sensor.BAYER`` atau "
"``sensor.JPEG`` (kini juga mendukung ``sensor.BINARY``\\ ). Kode yang "
"mengalokasikan framebuffer ekstra dalam format Bayer atau JPEG harus "
"menggunakan ``GRAYSCALE`` / ``RGB565`` (atau mengalokasikan buffer dengan "
"cara lain)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:158
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `f9e6b3fe0 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/f9e6b3fe0>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commit:* `f9e6b3fe0 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/f9e6b3fe0>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:163
msgid ":func:`sensor.set_framesize` raises on failure *(behavior)*"
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.set_framesize` memunculkan pengecualian saat gagal "
"*(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:165
msgid ""
":func:`sensor.set_framesize` now raises a ``ValueError`` when the framesize "
"is unsupported instead of returning ``False``. Code that checked the "
"``False`` return value must catch the ``ValueError`` exception instead."
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.set_framesize` kini memunculkan ``ValueError`` ketika ukuran "
"bingkai tidak didukung alih-alih mengembalikan ``False``\\ . Kode yang "
"memeriksa nilai kembalian ``False`` harus menangkap pengecualian "
"``ValueError``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:169
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `b0442633e <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/b0442633e>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commit:* `b0442633e <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/b0442633e>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:174
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Daftar periksa migrasi"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:176
msgid "For a clean port to v3.3.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr ""
"Untuk porting bersih ke v3.3.0, pekerjaan umum yang diperlukan adalah:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:178
msgid ""
"Port ``cpufreq`` code to integer-MHz ``set_frequency()`` and "
"``get_current_frequencies()`` / ``get_supported_frequencies()`` (:ref:`the "
"cpufreq rework <v3_3_0_cpufreq>`)."
msgstr ""
"Porting kode ``cpufreq`` ke ``set_frequency()`` integer-MHz dan "
"``get_current_frequencies()`` / ``get_supported_frequencies()`` (\\ "
":ref:`desain ulang cpufreq <v3_3_0_cpufreq>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:181
msgid ""
"Pass ``mask`` to ``image.replace()`` as a keyword (:ref:`the replace change "
"<v3_3_0_replace>`)."
msgstr ""
"Teruskan ``mask`` ke ``image.replace()`` sebagai kata kunci (\\ "
":ref:`perubahan replace <v3_3_0_replace>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:183
msgid ""
"Allocate extra framebuffers as ``GRAYSCALE`` / ``RGB565`` instead of "
"Bayer/JPEG (:ref:`the alloc_extra_fb change <v3_3_0_extrafb>`)."
msgstr ""
"Alokasikan framebuffer ekstra sebagai ``GRAYSCALE`` / ``RGB565`` alih-alih "
"Bayer/JPEG (\\ :ref:`perubahan alloc_extra_fb <v3_3_0_extrafb>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:185
msgid ""
"Catch ``ValueError`` around :func:`sensor.set_framesize` instead of checking"
" for ``False`` (:ref:`the set_framesize change <v3_3_0_setframesize>`)."
msgstr ""
"Tangkap ``ValueError`` di sekitar :func:`sensor.set_framesize` alih-alih "
"memeriksa ``False`` (\\ :ref:`perubahan set_framesize "
"<v3_3_0_setframesize>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.0.rst:188
msgid "All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "Semua skrip lainnya berjalan tanpa perubahan."
